  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h3 id=\"h6f20189-w9F2PiQf\" data-id=\"h6f20189-w9F2PiQf\">概要</h3><h4 id=\"hce1b53f-fuuJwKVT\" data-id=\"hce1b53f-fuuJwKVT\">含义</h4><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-EZHhr8uD\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-d6b068y9\">回调地址是一个用户自定义的链接地址，用户授权完成后，Marketing-API会并将授权相关的信息和state作为参数拼接至该回调地址，并进行跳转。</p></blockquote><h4 id=\"hce1b53f-lwvHYy9v\" data-id=\"hce1b53f-lwvHYy9v\">使用人群</h4><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-a6jzntn3\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BoXabxAe\">如果您是业务人员，在填写回调地址前，需要与内部技术人员沟通确定填写的地址。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cCJ1UFV6\">回调地址用于处理授权码的信息，只有整个流程畅通才可以顺利进行授权管理，所以需要技术人员进行相关业务开发，所以务必正确填写。</li></ul><h4 id=\"hce1b53f-LB9lGRao\" data-id=\"hce1b53f-LB9lGRao\">形式</h4><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-mUtWLIs6\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-S0Y8A5fs\">具体形式请与技术人员沟通自定义选择。</p></blockquote><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-X81BIjXx\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1EG5XWN4\">后端GET接口</li></ul><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"udcdd064-sjuyj7tp\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Q7OYSPf6\">将授权信息作为参数直接传递给指定的后端接口，由后端进行处理。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SXaxyF5x\">适用场景：仅后端逻辑应用，只需要处理token，客户授权完成后无需其他操作。</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Y7mgclVF\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-T0UUDmtF\">前端界面</li></ul><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"udcdd064-13D8LI0V\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bJa8AWEs\">由前端读取URL中的参数传递给后台做进一步处理。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0lg9j9cj\">适用场景：搭建了自定义的投放系统，客户授权后需要进行页面的操作。</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-5NdwyNiv\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-c6zoQgxv\">作用</li></ul><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-zwHIvuM5\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-z5a96aku\">在客户授权成功后，会生成auth_code（该字段为换取token的凭证，通过“<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取Access Token</a>”接口可换取接口调用凭证access-token），该参数将和state一起传递给回调地址，进行程序化的统一处理。</p></blockquote><h3 id=\"h6f20189-eEk9ZyjY\" data-id=\"h6f20189-eEk9ZyjY\">回调地址作用图示</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-dARcQiit\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/19f24c3c089d42a1a3ee0270c984ac1f~noop.image?x-expires=1988709079&amp;x-signature=eho4I82kkyfepTT04fO2T2%2FUan4%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 874px; visibility: visible; height: 582px;\" data-type=\"inline\">&nbsp;注：拼接授权地址可详见“授权”</p><h3 id=\"h6f20189-wWIUpmqI\" data-id=\"h6f20189-wWIUpmqI\">回调地址使用示例</h3><h4 id=\"hce1b53f-sKpMYGHX\" data-id=\"hce1b53f-sKpMYGHX\">后端GET接口</h4><h5 id=\"h7723ecd-HmEmoBdn\" data-id=\"h7723ecd-HmEmoBdn\">接口定义</h5><p data-id=\"p838747a-TFN886xw\">* URL：<br>*&nbsp;<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://your.server.domain/oauth2/callback\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">https://your.server.domain/oauth2/callback</a>/<br>*&nbsp;<strong>入参</strong></p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-id=\"t615773a-I4Em0Dca\" data-custom=\"false\" class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-7igF8JaI\"><col width=\"16.74259681093394%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c9d32d43-GGeW10h3\"><col width=\"8.314350797266515%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0e123f0-IjGAHfg5\"><col width=\"14.80637813211845%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"cc83eac3-1UX80miD\"><col width=\"60.13667425968109%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c31b2ba1-6657ZTOI\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-hi5hfe3Y\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-i7HZD8lX\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-2lQRMZ1N\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vOs2TUUD\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-KZ1OHfML\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-u9CPIkhM\">类型</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-bjY6UUn0\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kKzq70zF\">是否必填</p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-HO1Nkj94\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3OwDm8YA\">含义</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-fJiamjhU\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-QGDJ2G1h\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nCVEYpoY\">auth_code</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-hJXV0QMb\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1nnaDtek\">string</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-EE62c3VB\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-meiFViAR\">是</p></td><td data-id=\"t182d017-3ekB4hJm\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fEanjDGn\">授权码<br>用于换取Access-Token，可作为“<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取Access Token</a>”接口的请求参数进行调用获取访问凭证</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-VnETc63g\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t498e912-YUlWoKco\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Z1uStMUo\">state</p></td><td data-id=\"t498e912-jngKHKj1\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-pi0J41fm\">string</p></td><td data-id=\"t498e912-e6gTYerM\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-A6MIBYO1\">是</p></td><td data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-10MDdVVX\" colspan=\"1\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-viK0sj0K\">拼接授权链接时自定义拼装的参数，回调时原样返回<br>一些常见用法：<br>1. 校验是否是指定的授权（合理性）<br>2. 特殊逻辑处理（指定的客户需要根据一些参数进行特殊的处理，state=need_transfer）<br>3. 存储指定信息（例如希望给客户存储公司信息，在引导用户授权拼接授权url时设置state=company_name）</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h5 id=\"h7723ecd-W7MDXKvP\" data-id=\"h7723ecd-W7MDXKvP\">示例代码</h5><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20Python%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%5CnAPP_SECRET%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnAPP_ID%20%3D%200%5Cn%5Cn%40oauth2.route(%5C%22%2Fcallback%2F%5C%22)%5Cndef%20callback()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20auth_code%20%3D%20request.args.get(%5C%22auth_code%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20state%20%3D%20request.args.get(%5C%22state%5C%22)%20%20%23%20state%E5%8F%AF%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20auth_code%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20try%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20get_access_token_by_auth_code(auth_code)%20%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8auth_code%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8Ctoken%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E5%92%8C%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20except%20Exception%20as%20err%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20logging.warning(%5C%22get%20access_token%20failed%2C%20err%3D%25s%5C%22%2C%20err)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%5Cn%5Cndef%20get_access_token_by_auth_code(auth_code)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20auth_code%E6%8D%A2%E5%8F%96access-token%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%81https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopenapi%2Fdoc%2Findex.html%3Fid%3D1696710505596940%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20auth_code%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20import%20requests%5Cn%20%20%20%20open_api_url_prefix%20%3D%20%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fad.oceanengine.com%2Fopen_api%2F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20uri%20%3D%20%5C%22oauth2%2Faccess_token%2F%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20open_api_url_prefix%20%2B%20uri%5Cn%20%20%20%20data%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22app_id%5C%22%3A%20APP_ID%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22secret%5C%22%3A%20APP_SECRET%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22grant_type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22auth_code%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22auth_code%5C%22%3A%20auth_code%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.post(url%2C%20json%3Ddata)%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp_data%20%3D%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20save_oauth_to_db(rsp_data)%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B0%86access_token%E7%AD%89%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F44pg%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content python\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-ST5pIJMu\"><br></p><h4 id=\"hce1b53f-iRcK8SAB\" data-id=\"hce1b53f-iRcK8SAB\">前端界面链接</h4><h5 id=\"h7723ecd-06wo84Cg\" data-id=\"h7723ecd-06wo84Cg\">示例</h5><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-5Y1fgwIG\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VJc1I83S\"><strong>设置回调地址</strong>：&nbsp;<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://your.server.domain/index.html\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">https://your.server.domain/index.html</a><strong></strong></li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-YRyPPvvC\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/1222c227d8d341c9a8cba54ed87c26dd~noop.image?x-expires=1988709118&amp;x-signature=Ezw7ljhuea1QGXk%2BIF4GR%2FNNKMU%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 874px; visibility: visible; height: 198px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-25TOlO09\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-vdQRibZg\"><strong>授权成功后跳转指定回调地址</strong>:<br><a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://your.server.domain/index.html?state=your_custom_param&amp;auth_code=xxx：\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://your.server.domain/index.html?state=your_custom_param&amp;auth_code=xxx：</span></a></li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-VWAjjgbT\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/f26d338f70a14df68da54c89d045bbf6~noop.image?x-expires=1988709079&amp;x-signature=lfgKJgoCGf3C0OLE8zKX%2Bsjh2ts%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 874px; visibility: visible; height: 305px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-oNPUU2KY\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7rhF8Xs7\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">注：页面样式自定义，本页面仅作展示</span></li></ul><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"udcdd064-F68dv0KB\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8nHjFcdt\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">可由前端读取URL中的state和auth_code作为参数传给后端接口</span></li></ul></div>",
